		{"sestop", id=3, time=1500},
		{"excall", call=0, file="hat030060"},
		line=1630,
	},
	text={
		[1]={
			{
"Today, Akari and I arrive at school a little earlier than usual.",
			},
		},
		[2]={
			{
"We were told that Empress Hisui would be in attendance today.",
			},
		},
		[3]={
			{
"As promised, I need to be there to serve as her escort.",
			},
		},
		[4]={
			{
"I brought Akari along because there are certain places that I, as a man, cannot accompany her.",
			},
		},
		[5]={
			{
"At least, that's what I told her. In truth, I just don't want to have to leave Akari's side.",
			},
		},
		[6]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“...Why the heck do I have to protect my own impostor?”",
			},
		},
		[7]={
			{
"It seems my lord is less than thrilled by this arrangement.",
			},
		},
		[8]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Treat it as an opportunity to get as much information out of her as you can.”",
			},
		},
		[9]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Yeah, yeah, I know.”",
			},
		},
		[10]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Well? Have you come up with a way to confirm her identity?”",
			},
		},
		[11]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Yeah, pretty much.”",
			},
		},
		[12]={
			{
"The key is right in my pocket.",
			},
		},
		[13]={
			{
"Not a minute off from the scheduled time, an official Imperial limousine pulls up to the gate.",
			},
		},
		[14]={
			{
"I immediately approach the rear door and pull it open.",
			},
		},
		[15]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Good morning to you, Tokita. Miyaguni.”",
			},
		},
		[16]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“I entrust myself to your capable care today.”",
			},
		},
		[17]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Good morning, Your Majesty!”",
			},
		},
		[18]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“We are humbly at your service.”",
			},
		},
		[19]={
			{
"Empress Hisui steps outside and slides in between us.",
			},
		},
		[20]={
			{
"Her bodyguards in the car make no move to follow her.",
			},
		},
		[21]={
			{
"It seems like Elsa's already made the necessary arrangements.",
			},
		},
		[22]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Shall we be off?”",
			},
		},
		[23]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“We shall indeed.”",
			},
		},
		[24]={
			{
"Akari leads the way.",
			},
		},
		[25]={
			{
"I follow half a step behind Empress Hisui.",
			},
		},
		[26]={
			{
"There seems to be a certain skip to her gait.",
			},
		},
		[27]={
			{
"Indeed, it seems like she might even be enjoying this.",
			},
		},
		[28]={
			{
"I cast a sidelong glance at the petite girl walking beside me.",
			},
		},
		[29]={
			{
"Could she really be my own sister?",
			},
		},
		[30]={
			{
"I run my fingers once again across the slim object in my breast pocket.",
			},
		},
		[31]={
			{
"It's the comb I picked up in the ruins of House Tokita.",
			},
		},
		[32]={
			{
"According to Hotori, it might very well have belonged to Kanami.",
			},
		},
		[33]={
			{
"If Empress Hisui really is who we think she is, she'll surely react to it somehow.",
			},
		},
		[34]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Your Majesty.”",
			},
		},
		[35]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Yes?”",
			},
		},
		[36]={
			{
"Empress Hisui peers up at me with her round doe eyes.",
			},
		},
		[37]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I beg your pardon, but might you recognize this comb at all?”",
			},
		},
		[38]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“*Gasp!*”",
			},
		},
		[39]={
			{
"Her eyes seem to flash wide with recognition for the briefest of moments.",
			},
		},
		[40]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“M-Might I take a closer look?”",
			},
		},
		[41]={
			{
"I pass it over to her, and she turns it around over and over in her delicate hands.",
			},
		},
		[42]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“I am afraid I have never seen it before.”",
			},
		},
		[43]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Who might this belong to?”",
			},
		},
		[44]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“In truth, it belongs to my sister, whom I was separated from during the war.”",
			},
		},
		[45]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I have been searching for her ever since.”",
			},
		},
		[46]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“...Might I have her name?”",
			},
		},
		[47]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Her name is Kanami. She would be right around Your\nMajesty's age.”",
			},
		},
		[48]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“...Tokita.”",
			},
		},
		[49]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Yes?”",
			},
		},
		[50]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Whatever might be in that classroom over there?”",
			},
		},
		[51]={
			{
"Empress Hisui points to a classroom two doors down.",
			},
		},
		[52]={
			{
"It's just a vacant classroom, no matter how you look at it.",
			},
		},
		[53]={
			{
"I see. She wants to go somewhere away from prying eyes.",
			},
		},
		[54]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Shall I show you there, Your Majesty?”",
			},
		},
		[55]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Please do.”",
			},
		},
		[56]={
			{
"I silently signal Akari to go to class as normal before guiding Empress Hisui into the vacant classroom.",
			},
		},
		[57]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Your Majesty, what is the meaning...”",
			},
		},
		[58]={
			{
"As soon as we enter the room, Empress Hisui fixes me with an intense stare.",
			},
		},
		[59]={
			{
"In the very next moment, tears well up and spill over from her round eyes.",
			},
		},
		[60]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Onii-samaaa!”",
			},
		},
		[61]={
			{
"Empress Hisui leaps right into my arms.",
			},
		},
		[62]={
			{
"The impact of her body against mine immediately gives way to a feminine softness.",
			},
		},
		[63]={
			{
"It seems like Hotori was right on the money.",
			},
		},
		[64]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Can I... call you Kanami?”",
			},
		},
		[65]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Yes, it really is your Kanami! Your younger sister, your Kanami is right here!”",
			},
		},
		[66]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Oh, how I've yearned... for this day to finally come...”",
			},
		},
		[67]={
			{
"Kanami collapses to the ground, still clinging to my legs.",
			},
		},
		[68]={
			{
"When I gently take her hand and pull her upright, large teardrops stream down her cheeks and fall to the floor.",
			},
		},
		[69]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Onii-sama... Onii-sama... Onii-sama...!”",
			},
		},
		[70]={
			{
"She tightly clings to my uniform shirt, as though to never be separated from me again.",
			},
		},
		[71]={
			{
"There's absolutely no way that all of this is just an act.",
			},
		},
		[72]={
			{
"Thinking this, I finally wrap my hand around her trembling shoulders and comfortingly stroke her back.",
			},
		},
		[73]={
			{
"Ah, this delicate, fragile frame wrapped up in my arms.",
			},
		},
		[74]={
			{
"This warm, nostalgic fragrance filling up my lungs.",
			},
		},
		[75]={
			{
"My long-lost memories still remain out of reach, but for a single, brief moment, a recollection of those once-peaceful days flashes in my mind.",
			},
		},
		[76]={
			{
"Her familiar fragrance must have reawakened slumbering memories etched deeply upon my body.",
			},
		},
		[77]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'm so sorry...”",
			},
		},
		[78]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“All because I lost my memories, I never recognized you until now.”",
			},
		},
		[79]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Onii-sama...! *Sniffle...*”",
			},
		},
		[80]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Please, pay that no heed.”",
			},
		},
		[81]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Just seeing you alive already makes your Kanami so, so...”",
			},
		},
		[82]={
			{
"Kanami's voice catches in her throat.",
			},
		},
		[83]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“I knew it was you the moment we first met here.”",
			},
		},
		[84]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Ever since that day, I have dreamed again and again of leaping into your arms.”",
			},
		},
		[85]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“But if Okonogi were to learn of my reunion with you, there would be no telling what he might do!”",
			},
		},
		[86]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“And so, and so, I could not bring myself to reveal my identity to you!”",
			},
		},
		[87]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“That was wise of you, Kanami.”",
			},
		},
		[88]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Haah!”",
			},
		},
		[89]={
			{
"Just that tiniest amount of praise was enough to set her body trembling and leave her utterly speechless.",
			},
		},
		[90]={
			{
"It seems she adores me rather dearly.",
			},
		},
		[91]={
			{
"To think that I have so little love to give to her in return...",
			},
		},
		[92]={
			{
"The most I can do is to love her anew from this moment on.",
			},
		},
		[93]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“What a heartwarming reunion.”",
			},
		},
		[94]={
			{
"Akari calls out from behind us.",
			},
		},
		[95]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Ah!?”",
			},
		},
		[96]={
			{
"Kanami frantically puts some distance between us.",
			},
		},
		[97]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“It's okay. Akari knows everything.”",
			},
		},
		[98]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“There you have it, Tokita Kanami-san.”",
			},
		},
		[99]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Nice to meet you again. I'm Miyaguni Akari.”",
			},
		},
		[100]={
			{
"Kanami warily looks back and forth between the two of us.",
			},
		},
		[101]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“It's all right.”",
			},
		},
		[102]={
			{
"I give a reassuring nod, and Kanami finally steps up in front of Akari.",
			},
		},
		[103]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“I am Kanami of House Tokita, and Soujin's younger stepsister. It is a pleasure to make your acquaintance.”",
			},
		},
		[104]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Mhm, it's a pleasure.”",
			},
		},
		[105]={
			{
"Kanami offers her a deep bow in return.",
			},
		},
		[106]={
			{
"Naturally, it's in the manner of a warrior.",
			},
		},
		[107]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Here you go.”",
			},
		},
		[108]={
			{
"Akari holds out her handkerchief.",
			},
		},
		[109]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Wipe your tears.”",
			},
		},
		[110]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“R-Right! Thank you very much...”",
			},
		},
		[111]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“That makes twice that you've handed me a handkerchief now.”",
			},
		},
		[112]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Sure is. We just might be soulmates, huh?”",
			},
		},
		[113]={
			{
"Is Akari bringing up this idea of “soulmates” to poke fun at her?",
			},
		},
		[114]={
			{
"Between these two, there absolutely does exists a deeper connection; an inescapably terrible meeting of fates.",
			},
		},
		[115]={
			{
"Not the mere serendipity of a chance encounter, but the fateful ties between that of a genuine article and an impostor.",
			},
		},
		[116]={
			{
"That of a grave and unexpiated sin and an avenging impulse that cries out for satisfaction.",
			},
		},
		[117]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'd love nothing more than to enjoy our reunion, but I believe you owe us an explanation, Kanami.”",
			},
		},
		[118]={
			{
"Kanami's smile fades away once she hears the tone of my voice.",
			},
		},
		[119]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Yes, of course.”",
			},
		},
		[120]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Allow me to explain.”",
			},
		},
		[121]={
			{
"Her voice barely above a whisper, Kanami begins to speak of the past.",
			},
		},
		[122]={
			{
"Of that fateful day three years ago─",
			},
		},
		[123]={
			{
"When the war broke out on that day, Kanami was out shopping for dinner away from the Warrior District.",
			},
		},
		[124]={
			{
"And so, she was fortunate enough to survive the bombing.",
			},
		},
		[125]={
			{
"Seeing the Warrior District in flames, she rushed home at once from the greengrocer.",
			},
		},
		[126]={
			{
"But right at that moment, she caught a glimpse of me.",
			},
		},
		[127]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I was headed for the Imperial Palace?”",
			},
		},
		[128]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Yes, I have absolutely no doubts.”",
			},
		},
		[129]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“You were leaping across the rooftops at blinding speed in the direction of the palace.”",
			},
		},
		[130]={
			{
"I inexplicably begin sweating with excitement at this revelation.",
			},
		},
		[131]={
			{
"According to Hotori, I broke off from the Myougi Squad to head off on my own as soon as hostilities commenced.",
			},
		},
		[132]={
			{
"Now, for the very first time, I've learned what happened after that.",
			},
		},
		[133]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Of course, I chased after you, Onii-sama.”",
			},
		},
		[134]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“I remember running and running and running, until I finally found you.”",
			},
		},
		[135]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“What was I doing?”",
			},
		},
		[136]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“You were locked in single combat with someone.”",
			},
		},
		[137]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Single combat?”",
			},
		},
		[138]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Do you mean to say that my opponent was a warrior?”",
			},
		},
		[139]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“I do not know. I only saw you for the briefest of moments.”",
			},
		},
		[140]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Before I knew it, the both of us were caught up in a mighty explosion.”",
			},
		},
		[141]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Everything turned white, and my body felt like it was floating... and I do not remember anything else...”",
			},
		},
		[142]={
			{
"This is valuable testimony.",
			},
		},
		[143]={
			{
"Thanks to her account, what I did during the war has gotten a little clearer.",
			},
		},
		[144]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“What happened to you after the explosion?”",
			},
		},
		[145]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“When I woke up, I was lying in an unfamiliar bed in the Imperial Palace.”",
			},
		},
		[146]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“One of Okonogi's servants had found me at the site of the explosion.”",
			},
		},
		[147]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Okonogi himself proceeded to explain the situation the Empire found itself in.”",
			},
		},
		[148]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“The fact that the Warrior District was razed to the ground, and that he was about to sign a peace treaty with the Republic.”",
			},
		},
		[149]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Also, that Empress Suou was dead, and that her sole\ndaughter's whereabouts were unknown.”",
			},
		},
		[150]={
			{
"The war began with the bombing of the Warrior District and ended with Okonogi signing the peace treaty.",
			},
		},
		[151]={
			{
"What she is describing must have taken place sometime between those two points.",
			},
		},
		[152]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Okonogi said that we absolutely needed an Empress to preserve the will of the Imperial people.”",
			},
		},
		[153]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“He argued that if the Imperial Family were to cease to exist, the very soul of the Empire would have been lost to the Republic.”",
			},
		},
		[154]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“And so... he asked me to become the Empress.”",
			},
		},
		[155]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“That man's sure got some nerve...”",
			},
		},
		[156]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“The prospect of acting as a substitute for the Empress was so overwhelming that I nearly fainted on the spot.”",
			},
		},
		[157]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“But... I accepted his request on the condition that he search for you, Onii-sama.”",
			},
		},
		[158]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You did it all so you could find me, huh?”",
			},
		},
		[159]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Yes...”",
			},
		},
		[160]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“I never lost faith that you would still be alive.”",
			},
		},
		[161]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“No matter what, no matter when, I yearned to see you once again.”",
			},
		},
		[162]={
			{
"Kanami breaks our gaze as she softly murmurs this to herself.",
			},
		},
		[163]={
			{
"I never knew that she felt so strongly for me.",
			},
		},
		[164]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I think that was the right decision. If you'd refused, Okonogi might've killed you right then and there.”",
			},
		},
		[165]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“But why in the world did he have to choose you of all people?”",
			},
		},
		[166]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“I only learned of this later, but his reasoning was that because most warriors were already deceased, there would be few who could recognize my true identity.”",
			},
		},
		[167]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Moreover, he could count on a daughter of warriors to have a minimum degree of education.”",
			},
		},
		[168]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Thank you. I think I understand what happened now.”",
			},
		},
		[169]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“I apologize for having taken so much of your time.”",
			},
		},
		[170]={
			{
"Kanami offers the two of us a gracious bow.",
			},
		},
		[171]={
			{
"She's beautiful, considerate, and possessed of a passionate heart.",
			},
		},
		[172]={
			{
"...What a wonderful sister I have.",
			},
		},
		[173]={
			{
"I'm sure my past self must have been quite fond of her.",
			},
		},
		[174]={
			{
"That's why, even without any memories of her, ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"I wish I could hold her dear.",
{"/font"},
			},
		},
		[175]={
			{
"Would only that she had not impersonated the Empress...",
			},
		},
		[176]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I would ask you one last thing.”",
			},
		},
		[177]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Yes, anything at all.”",
			},
		},
		[178]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“What say you to having impersonated the Empress?”",
			},
		},
		[179]={
			{
"I get straight to the point.",
			},
		},
		[180]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“That is...”",
			},
		},
		[181]={
			{
"Kanami struggles for words, clenching and unclenching her fists by her side.",
			},
		},
		[182]={
			{
"Eventually, she squeezes her hands tightly shut.",
			},
		},
		[183]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“As a daughter of warriors, I believe I ought to have refused, even if it meant taking my own life.”",
			},
		},
		[184]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“And yet... I still made the terrible choice to sell my soul of my own free will.”",
			},
		},
		[185]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“All that remains for me is to offer my unworthy life in atonement.”",
			},
		},
		[186]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I see... I suppose that's only right.”",
			},
		},
		[187]={
			{
"I got the answer I was hoping for, but it doesn't make me any happier.",
			},
		},
		[188]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Hold it right there!”",
			},
		},
		[189]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“What the hell is 'right' about any of this?!”",
			},
		},
		[190]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Isn't she your own family? She was forced into becoming the Empress just so she could search for you!”",
			},
		},
		[191]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“The only one who did anything wrong is Okonogi for taking advantage of her!”",
			},
		},
		[192]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“It's precisely because we are family that we have to see justice done.”",
			},
		},
		[193]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“See justice done? What sorta sick joke is that?!”",
			},
		},
		[194]={
			{
"Akari turns away in disgust, as though refusing to even entertain the notion.",
			},
		},
		[195]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Would you be able to forgive your own family if they were a murderer?”",
			},
		},
		[196]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“W-Well, um... I guess I'd tell them to turn themselves in...”",
			},
		},
		[197]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Lese majesty is a very serious crime, and impersonating the Imperial Family is among the most heinous of offenses.”",
			},
		},
		[198]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“If her crimes had come to light before the war, she would certainly have been summarily sentenced to commit suicide right on the spot.”",
			},
		},
		[199]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Miyaguni-sama, everything Onii-sama has said is more than reasonable.”",
			},
		},
		[200]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“For one raised in warrior society, all of this goes without saying. I have every intention to eventually set things right.”",
			},
		},
		[201]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“I did not have any pretenses about what I was doing when I agreed to become Okonogi's pawn.”",
			},
		},
		[202]={
			{
"Kanami shows Akari a kindly smile.",
			},
		},
		[203]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Soujin, c'mere!”",
			},
		},
		[204]={
			{
"Before I can respond, Akari already has her hands around my shirt collar.",
			},
		},
		[205]={
			{
"I'm dragged unceremoniously into a corner of the classroom.",
			},
		},
		[206]={
			{
"She yanks my face down until my eyes are level with hers.",
			},
		},
		[207]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“This is an order.”",
			},
		},
		[208]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Don't you dare blame Kanami ever again.”",
			},
		},
		[209]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin & Akari"},
			{
"“I'm not bla─” “Yes, you are!”",
			},
		},
		[210]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“If you keep encouraging her like that, Kanami might really up and kill herself!”",
			},
		},
		[211]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Kanami herself says she wishes to atone for her crimes.”",
			},
		},
		[212]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Then put it off for as long as you can. Stop trying to push her, in any case.”",
			},
		},
		[213]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“It's a miracle that she even managed to survive the war!\nThere's no reason she should rush to her death.”",
			},
		},
		[214]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“It's all Okonogi's fault in the first place.”",
			},
		},
		[215]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“As a warrior, Kanami still should have─”",
			},
		},
		[216]={
			{
"She interrupts me by dragging me in even closer until our noses are nearly touching.",
			},
		},
		[217]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“This-is-an-order!”",
			},
		},
		[218]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“What do you say?!”",
			},
		},
		[219]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“...Understood.”",
			},
		},
		[220]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Excellent.”",
			},
		},
		[221]={
			{
"She finally releases me.",
			},
		},
		[222]={
			{
"Talk about playing dirty.",
			},
		},
		[223]={
			{
"I, too, want nothing more than for Kanami to be spared her life.",
			},
		},
		[224]={
			{
"But the world is not so kind as to grant absolution without the proper penance.",
			},
		},
		[225]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Got a problem?”",
			},
		},
		[226]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“No, I'll obey my lord's orders.”",
			},
		},
		[227]={
			{
"The two of us return to where Kanami is standing.",
			},
		},
		[228]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Is your matter resolved?”",
			},
		},
		[229]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Yeah, we're all good.”",
			},
		},
		[230]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“That's enough talk about crimes and punishments.”",
			},
		},
		[231]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“We have an important goal to work towards as the student council, don't we?”",
			},
		},
		[232]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Indeed, we do.”",
			},
		},
		[233]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“I shall faithfully carry out my role as Empress, at least until we are able to achieve our ambitions.”",
			},
		},
		[234]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Mmm, that's not how I wanted you to interpret that...”",
			},
		},
		[235]={
			{
"Akari shows her a chagrined smile.",
			},
		},
		[236]={
			{
"It must be because of our shared upbringing that Kanami and I feel the same way about what is right and just.",
			},
		},
		[237]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Hey, Kanami, can I ask you a question?”",
			},
		},
		[238]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Yes, of course.”",
			},
		},
		[239]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You said you yourself wanted to turn the Empire into a democracy, but do you really mean it?”",
			},
		},
		[240]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Indeed I do. I believe the authority to govern should be held by each and every one of the Empire's citizens.”",
			},
		},
		[241]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“With that in mind, the institution of the Imperial Family ought to be abolished.”",
			},
		},
		[242]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Hard to believe those words could come from the daughter of warriors.”",
			},
		},
		[243]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Onii-sama... did you not agree with my intentions the other day?”",
			},
		},
		[244]={
			{
"She gives me a puzzled look.",
			},
		},
		[245]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'm sorry, but our ultimate goal has always been to take back the Empire from the Republic.”",
			},
		},
		[246]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Put simply, we aim to restore the Empire to how it was before the war.”",
			},
		},
		[247]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Naturally, we would need the Empress to lead the charge, as a standard for our cause.”",
			},
		},
		[248]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Does that mean you lied to Elsa-sama, then?”",
			},
		},
		[249]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I suppose we did.”",
			},
		},
		[250]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“But we do intend to cooperate with her as far as defeating Okonogi goes.”",
			},
		},
		[251]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“But then you intend to turn your blades against Elsa-sama?”",
			},
		},
		[252]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“How could you stoop to such a despicable act of betrayal?”",
			},
		},
		[253]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“They were the ones who burned the Warrior District to the ground and massacred all its residents.”",
			},
		},
		[254]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“If you're the daughter of warriors, you should understand.”",
			},
		},
		[255]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“No, I do not.”",
			},
		},
		[256]={
			{
"Kanami declares her opposition in no uncertain terms.",
			},
		},
		[257]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Indeed, I would be lying if I said I harbored no resentment for the Republic.”",
			},
		},
		[258]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“But to me, the Imperial Family is equally unforgivable.”",
			},
		},
		[259]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Where the heck did that come from?!”",
			},
		},
		[260]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Tell me, what did Empress Suou do for her people during the war?”",
			},
		},
		[261]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“She alone was entrusted to wield Three Sacred Treasures, yet she never made use of them to repel the Republican Army.”",
			},
		},
		[262]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“That's─”",
			},
		},
		[263]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“By the end of the war, the existence of the Imperial Family served as nothing more than a convenient pretext to legitimize Okonogi's tyranny.”",
			},
		},
		[264]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
{"font", size=51},
"“The same Imperial Family for whom the warriors gave the last measure of their devotion, only to have their positions and their spellblades─their very souls─stripped away from them.”",
{"/font"},
			},
		},
		[265]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“And now, the public treats them as little more than war criminals.”",
			},
		},
		[266]={
			{
"Akari silently bites down on her lip, unable to come up with any retort.",
			},
		},
		[267]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You say that as the current Empress, Kanami. Doesn't that make you an accomplice to all of Okonogi's wrongdoings?”",
			},
		},
		[268]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“It is just as you say.”",
			},
		},
		[269]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“I knew from the very start that I would never be able to go back to those blissful days I once knew.”",
			},
		},
		[270]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“So at the very least, I wish to destroy all that was responsible for bringing the Empire to ruin in the first place.”",
			},
		},
		[271]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“That includes Okonogi himself, the wicked girl who willingly became his puppet... but also the wicked Imperial system that gave him his power.”",
			},
		},
		[272]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Without the Sworn Blades, there are none left in the Empire who are capable of standing up to Okonogi.”",
			},
		},
		[273]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“But as his accomplice, I am in a position to be able to undermine him from within.”",
			},
		},
		[274]={
			{
"Kanami asserts all this with a steel-firm resolve.",
			},
		},
		[275]={
			{
"But what she doesn't know is that the Sworn Blades still live.",
			},
		},
		[276]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Even so, I don't see that as any reason to get rid of the role of the Empress.”",
			},
		},
		[277]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Empress Hisui is widely popular among the citizenry, isn't she?”",
			},
		},
		[278]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Even among the warriors, I'm sure plenty of them rely on her for emotional support.”",
			},
		},
		[279]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“They're merely being deceived. The role of the Empress is nothing more than a construct occupied by an impostor like me.”",
			},
		},
		[280]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Then what if it were occupied by the real deal?”",
			},
		},
		[281]={
			{
"Akari narrows her eyes dangerously.",
			},
		},
		[282]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Akari!”",
			},
		},
		[283]={
			{
"I cut her off before she goes any further.",
			},
		},
		[284]={
			{
"It'd be bad for her to get carried away and carelessly reveal her identity.",
			},
		},
		[285]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You really don't trust me, huh?”",
			},
		},
		[286]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Just playing it safe.”",
			},
		},
		[287]={
			{
"As Akari and I bicker back and forth, Kanami frowns at me with a slightly pouty expression.",
			},
		},
		[288]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“You two may not be aware of this...”",
			},
		},
		[289]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“...But the real Empress is indeed alive.”",
			},
		},
		[290]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Where?”",
			},
		},
		[291]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“I do not know where she is.”",
			},
		},
		[292]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“But right before the Persica Blossom Festival this year, I overheard Okonogi talking with Empress Suou's daughter.”",
			},
		},
		[293]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Her Highness was full of passion, vowing that she would defeat Okonogi...”",
			},
		},
		[294]={
			{
"She must be talking about the time Akari and I snuck into the Imperial Palace.",
			},
		},
		[295]={
			{
"Kanami overheard us, huh?",
			},
		},
		[296]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Because of that, I have all the more reason to make haste.”",
			},
		},
		[297]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“I resent the notion of entrusting the future of the Empire to a princess who hid away and allowed her people to suffer for three long years without lifting a finger.”",
			},
		},
		[298]={
			{
"I open my mouth to argue back, but swallow my words upon seeing Akari's face.",
			},
		},
		[299]={
			{
"She faces Kanami head-on, receiving all of her criticism with a sincere expression.",
			},
		},
		[300]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Classes are about to begin soon.”",
			},
		},
		[301]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“It would set a bad example if the Empress herself were to be late.”",
			},
		},
		[302]={
			{
"If Kanami is going to head off to class, we need to accompany her as her escorts.",
			},
		},
		[303]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“I am terribly sorry our reunion had to turn our like this, Onii-sama.”",
			},
		},
		[304]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Your Kanami, too, wished for nothing more than to share in the joy of finally being reunited with you.”",
			},
		},
		[305]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“So much has changed since three years ago, huh?”",
			},
		},
		[306]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“But even still, you will always be my Onii-sama.”",
			},
		},
		[307]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'll always think of you as my dear sister, too.”",
			},
		},
		[308]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“In that case...”",
			},
		},
		[309]={
			{
"Kanami approaches me.",
			},
		},
		[310]={
			{
"Then, as a child might with a parent, she hugs me without hesitation.",
			},
		},
		[311]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“...Kanami?”",
			},
		},
		[312]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Please allow me this once in a while, Onii-sama.”",
			},
		},
		[313]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Your Kanami does not wish for much.”",
			},
		},
		[314]={
			{
"The sweet fragrance drifting from her body immediately sends my head spinning.",
			},
		},
		[315]={
			{
"─She's my own sister.",
			},
		},
		[316]={
			{
"─She's my own sister, making a display of her familial love.",
			},
		},
		[317]={
			{
"As I repeat this thought to myself, I tentatively reach out and gently stroke her hair.",
			},
		},
		[318]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“...”",
			},
		},
		[319]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Er...? Ahem!”",
			},
		},
		[320]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You will be late for class, Your Majesty!”",
			},
		},
		[321]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“...”",
			},
		},
		[322]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Huh?”",
			},
		},
		[323]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“What might be the matter?”",
			},
		},
		[324]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Nah, it's nothing.”",
			},
		},
		[325]={
			{
"The three of us head in the direction of our classrooms.",
			},
		},
		[326]={
			{
"As soon as we're freed from our escort duties, we'll need to get Hotori up to speed and decide on a course of action moving forward.",
			},
		},
		[327]={
			{
"Empress Hisui excuses herself in the middle of third period to attend to her official duties.",
			},
		},
		[328]={
			{
"Immediately afterwards, I call Hotori to explain our findings.",
			},
		},
		[329]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“So it really was Kanami after all...”",
			},
		},
		[330]={
			{
"Once I give her the rundown, Hotori lets out a heavy sigh.",
			},
		},
		[331]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I suppose I should hate her for it, but it's hard to do that to someone I've known my whole life...”",
			},
		},
		[332]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Kanami seems to think of herself as more responsible than anyone.”",
			},
		},
		[333]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Apparently she was plotting to tear down the Imperial system all by herself.”",
			},
		},
		[334]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“But then she met Elsa, and they came up with Operation Bellflower together.”",
			},
		},
		[335]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Her way of repenting for impersonating the Empress?”",
			},
		},
		[336]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“That, and disillusionment with the Imperial Family.”",
			},
		},
		[337]={
			{
"Akari tacks on that which I didn't dare to say.",
			},
		},
		[338]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I didn't expect Kanami to seriously be after the abolition of the Imperial system.”",
			},
		},
		[339]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I just assumed she'd unconditionally side with us.”",
			},
		},
		[340]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“It's definitely bad news that she's on Elsa's side.”",
			},
		},
		[341]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“If Elsa learns what we're planning, the whole operation will fall apart.”",
			},
		},
		[342]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I suppose we'll have to bring her over to our side.”",
			},
		},
		[343]={
			{
"Empress Hisui is revered by a great many Imperial citizens.",
			},
		},
		[344]={
			{
"If we're unable to prove Akari's lineage, there's a real possibility we'll need her to continue acting as the Empress.",
			},
		},
		[345]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I'll handle winning her over.”",
			},
		},
		[346]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“If Kanami resents the Imperial Family, I think I'm the only one capable of convincing her otherwise.”",
			},
		},
		[347]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“And I have to do it for my own sake, too.”",
			},
		},
		[348]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“What do you mean?”",
			},
		},
		[349]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“She's not wrong. It ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"was",
{"/font"},
" us─the Imperial Family─who betrayed her.”",
			},
		},
		[350]={
			{
"Even though she was meant to protect us, Empress Suou was defeated without ever using the Three Sacred Treasures.",
			},
		},
		[351]={
			{
"Even though the warriors bled and died for their country, the new government coldly condemned them as war criminals.",
			},
		},
		[352]={
			{
"And even though she was well aware of all this injustice, the surviving Imperial Princess idly hid herself away and refused to take any action.",
			},
		},
		[353]={
			{
"For Kanami, who doesn't know any better, this is how the world truly seems.",
			},
		},
		[354]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“It's easy to blame it all on the Republic for invading, but I have to reflect on my own responsibility.”",
			},
		},
		[355]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I don't want anyone to be able to say, 'Oh, that fake Empress was more worthy.'”",
			},
		},
		[356]={
			{
"She tries to pass it off as a joke, but Akari's expression is deadly serious.",
			},
		},
		[357]={
			{
"Kanami's repudiation of the Imperial Family is more than justified.",
			},
		},
		[358]={
			{
"Even putting aside the question of lineage, this challenge to the very legitimacy of the Imperial system is a wall that Akari herself needs to overcome.",
			},
		},
	},
	label={
	},
}
